MGT UNICORN SUITE v0.3.1-beta (Win x64)
Polyprotocol client of The Montreal
Greek Times. Retro Mode: Web 1.0,
Gopher, WAIS, Archie, Telnet, Finger,
QOTD, ARPA mail, CU-SeeMe TV, IRC.
Modern Mode: Live TV, Live Radio,
Newspaper, Website.
Free software, AGPLv3.
